    "body": "## RESEARCH CONTINUATION — MATHEMATICAL WORLD / PIXEL / PERSPECTIVE LEARNING R01\n\nBRANCH = `research/zorr-studio-mathematics-r01`\nCOMMIT = `d051d3e48c1bab0dd5b40e1432653ffdd1505a20`\nFILE = `docs/research/studio-mathematics/MATHEMATICAL_WORLD_PERSPECTIVE_LEARNING_R01.md`\nMAIN_MUTATION = NO\nMERGE = NO\nCANON_LOCK = NO\n\nOWNER requested that the pixel/perspective/world-mathematics learning from the current session be made durable so later chats can restore and continue it rather than relearn from chat memory.\n\nDurable learning now records:\n- pixel-first quantitative measurement and exact raster/hash discipline;\n- strict separation of `GEOMETRIC_FREE`, `VISUAL_EMPTY`, and perspective-correct physical area;\n- R02 location mask results and their semantic-calibration limits;\n- vanishing-point / horizon / orthogonal-VP focal calibration for R03;\n- image<->floor homography and Jacobian area correction;\n- camera-height-normalized world coordinates and projection-derived object scale;\n- categorical canon-state algebra (`LOCKED/OBSERVED/OPEN/QUARANTINE/SUPERSEDED`) without invented truth probabilities;\n- `OPEN != INVENT`, unknown chronology/transport remain symbolic;\n- element-specific Facet state spaces instead of an invented universal scalar power score;\n- multi-field composition mathematics;\n- explicit warning that the anime screenshot measurement is UI-contaminated and is not a clean style benchmark.\n\nBounded result:\n`MATHEMATICAL_WORLD_PERSPECTIVE_LEARNING_R01 = PASS`\n\nImportant non-claims remain explicit: external semantic ground truth, physical meter scale, universal style thresholds, and production effectiveness are `NOT PROVEN`.",
